# The view's own words. Placeholders ({ $name }) must stay; their order may change.

## The Undo menu item.
# { $label } is what the change was ("Turn on Noise suppression").
undo-change = Undo { $label }
# { $by } is who made the change when it was not the person at the keyboard ("assistant").
undo-change-by = Undo { $label }, by { $by }
